    "text": "The McDonald's Original Pokémon Card Game ADV: McDonald's restaurants across Japan gave one of five cards at random with each Happy Meal from 17 January to 6 February 2003. They were the Hoenn starters Treecko, Torchic and Mudkip, drawn by Atsuko Nishida, with Latias and Latios, numbered 003 to 007 ADV-P and carrying the McDonald's logo in the bottom left corner. The same art came in English as Nintendo Black Star Promos.",
